/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Wireless\040sensor\040network\040coverage\040optimization\040based\040on\040whale\040group\040algorithm)
/Author (Lei\040Wang\054\040Weihua\040Wu\054\040Junyan\040Qi\054\040Zongpu\040Jia)
/Subject (For\040all\040of\040types\040of\040applications\040in\040wireless\040sensor\040networks\040\050WSNs\051\054\040coverage\040is\040a\040fundamental\040and\040hot\040topic\040research\040issue\040To\040monitor\040the\040interest\040field\040and\040obtain\040the\040valid\040data\054\040the\040paper\040proposes\040a\040wireless\040sensor\040network\040coverage\040optimization\040model\040based\040on\040improved\040whale\040algorithm\040The\040mathematic\040model\040of\040node\040coverage\040in\040wireless\040sensor\040networks\040is\040developed\040to\040achieve\040full\040coverage\040for\040the\040interest\040area\040For\040the\040model\054\040the\040idea\040of\040reverse\040learning\040is\040introduced\040into\040the\040original\040whale\040swarm\040optimization\040algorithm\040to\040optimize\040the\040initial\040distribution\040of\040the\040population\040This\040method\040enhances\040the\040node\040search\040capability\040and\040speeds\040up\040the\040global\040search\040The\040experiment\040shows\040that\040this\040algorithm\040can\040effectively\040improve\040the\040coverage\040of\040nodes\040in\040wireless\040sensor\040networks\040and\040optimize\040the\040network\040performance)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0402018\054\040Computer\040Science\040and\040Information\040Systems\054\040Wireless\040sensor\040network\054\040Node\040\050networking\051\054\040Population\054\040Network\040performance)
>>
